## Training Details
The **Granite Uncertainty 3.2 8b** model is an aLoRA adapter finetuned to provide certainty scores mimicking the output of a calibrator trained via the method in [[Shen et al. ICML 2024] Thermometer: Towards Universal Calibration for Large Language Models](https://arxiv.org/abs/2403.08819).



